<p>karo maatam shahe mazloom ka (2)<br />
 Azaae shaah ke aaye zamaane </p>

<p>1) Hui aamad shahedee'n ki dakan me<br />
hai maatam shaah ka haar anjuman me<br />
qiza chaati hai ahmad ke chaman me<br />
 karo maatam shahe mazloom ka</p>

<p>
2) Hue hai karbala waale jo mehmaa'n<br />
aza-e-shaah ke hote hai saamaa'n<br />
karo tum chaak apne ab garebaa'n<br />
 karo maatam shahe mazloom ka</p>

<p>
3) Ye kaisi rounaqe bazme azaa hai<br />
ye dunya kis ke gham me ghamzada hai<br />
yahi maatam zamaane ki baqa hai<br />
 karo maatam shahe mazloom ka</p>

<p>
4) Tamanna-e-dile zainab yahi hai<br />
yahi to haasile sad zindagi hai<br />
yahi nusrat ghame shabbir ki hai<br />
 karo maatam shahe mazloom ka</p>